hings you want might think of as  more speculative or more fun the crypto  gold bars fine wine  old masters paintings those kind of  things do they come into your  spectrum of you know advice or do you  say do that if you like but that's not  okay well i'm going to give you a very  well win tour of what i call the three  pot theory okay okay so we all have  three people  so we all roughly speaking he has three  pots pot one liquid stuff cash comes in  salary rental income dividends whatever  out of that all the fun stuff you like  to do restaurants theater living more  than used to  right now  port three is what i call the it's  illiquid port it's got your house in it  um it might have the fundsmiths or the  sort of fund managers we were talking  about and it might have  things like crypto it might have fine  wine vintage cars whatever so i  sometimes call it the passion pot  and as investors  that's the port we actually quite enjoy  port two the port two in the middle is  where you drive you know core sleep well  returns and that's where a group like  net wealth comes in doing the bits you  don't enjoy as much but making sure you  have that in a low cost flexible format  and then actually you can get flows that  go from two into one if you need to top  up your cash or from two into three if  you find another passion so if you're  dead set on crypto you could do a little  bit in your passion pot but i definitely  wouldn't make it a core part of your  overall investing  all right do you want to tell us what's  in your passion pot  [Laughter]  oh dear well  or give us any other final 30 seconds  my husband collects railway memorabilia  so he's the world leading expert on the  flying scotsman which has its centenary  next year there we are so a very last  word for a few seconds charlotte if  you'd like to  i i think my parting words to um to your  long-suffering audience is listen to an  hour of us telling everyone how how  difficult it all is is to go back to  this co